Package: kerno
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Evan Pluchart
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Suggests: postgresql-client, default-mysql-client | mariadb-client
Section: database
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/EvanPluchart/kerno
Description: fast, native database client for PostgreSQL and MySQL
 Kerno is an open-source database client written in Rust with GPUI. It
 browses schemas, runs and explains SQL, edits table data in transactions,
 and exports, imports, backs up and restores, for PostgreSQL, MySQL and
 MariaDB. Backup and restore use the client tools suggested here.
